cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "LLVM BOLT with .NET 10 Native AOT on Linux x86-64"
abstract: >-
  This repository documents an LLVM BOLT experiment on Linux x86-64 executables
  built with .NET 10 Native AOT. It provides a minimal reproducer for a BOLT crash
  during whole-file processing, source and scripts for a profile-guided experiment
  on the statically linked Brotli encoder, and the raw measurements.
authors:
